{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/9cc77f7b9b72fa5df652a5b275c32eb5.avif?t=1759295092\" width=1560 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore disparate dreams connected via photographs, films, retro games, and more. Each world presents its own mysteries and items to collect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/a329df661f82b0dc1c90083dd334c467.poster.avif?t=1759295092\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/a329df661f82b0dc1c90083dd334c467.webm?t=1759295092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/a329df661f82b0dc1c90083dd334c467.mp4?t=1759295092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/bafd85ba587158c999956ed1249f478b.avif?t=1759295092\" width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many worlds are suitable for leisure but others pose more of a threat\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like any dream, things can turn sour quickly if you\u2019re not careful. Getting hit by a car or falling into the void may send you towards the darker side of the dreamscape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/e1a7b7a31f4c92e377d6e997b8e7edcc.poster.avif?t=1759295092\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/e1a7b7a31f4c92e377d6e997b8e7edcc.webm?t=1759295092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/e1a7b7a31f4c92e377d6e997b8e7edcc.mp4?t=1759295092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/2b48f3dc7728698abc63ca2a41c7e08f.avif?t=1759295092\" width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the unique mechanics of the various frames and items you gather along the way to overcome obstacles in novel ways.\u00a0As you progress you will find equipment that can take you further into the dream. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/079e60f9ce5923a5a00a8972186dd5da.avif?t=1759295092\" width=1560 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The camera is one of the more powerful items you will come across, allowing you to create your own frames where and whenever you please and return to them at a moment's notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/841b96c4a27a6343a882b2efe3528426.poster.avif?t=1759295092\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/841b96c4a27a6343a882b2efe3528426.webm?t=1759295092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/841b96c4a27a6343a882b2efe3528426.mp4?t=1759295092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images